## How photos attach

- Mapping lives in `lib/finder-manual-photos.ts`.
- Finder resolves photos by `directory_manual.address_maps_link` (not by name).
- Do **not** delete the PNG files or clear the map when rebuilding the manual directory.

## After a new manual directory import

1. Confirm these 4 are still in the new payload.
2. If their Google Maps links are unchanged, photos work automatically.
3. If a Maps link changed, update the key in `lib/finder-manual-photos.ts` (keep the same PNG filename).
4. If name/district changed but it is the same person, match by name and re-link the existing asset.
